{"root":"pecah","ipa":"/pəˈtʃah/","core":"破碎，裂开，破裂","pos":["动词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pəˈtʃah/","zh":"破碎，裂开，破裂","phrases":[{"t":"pecah kaca","zh":"玻璃破裂"},{"t":"pecah telur","zh":"破蛋，打破鸭蛋（比喻取得首个进球或成果）"},{"t":"pecah rekor","zh":"打破纪录"}],"examples":[{"t":"Gelas itu jatuh dan pecah berkeping-keping.","zh":"那个杯子掉下来碎成了好几片。"},{"t":"Suaranya pecah karena terharu.","zh":"由于感动，他的声音哽咽沙哑了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"pecah","ipa":"/pəˈtʃah/","zh":"破碎的，裂开的","phrase":{"t":"pecah belah","zh":"四分五裂的"},"example":{"t":"Persatuan mereka jangan sampai pecah belah.","zh":"他们的团结切莫四分五裂。"}},{"w":"memecah","ipa":"/məˈmɛtʃah/","zh":"打破，劈开","phrase":{"t":"memecah kayu","zh":"劈柴"},"example":{"t":"Dia memecah kayu untuk api unggun.","zh":"他劈柴用来生篝火。"}},{"w":"memecahkan","ipa":"/məˈmɛtʃahkan/","zh":"打破，解决","phrase":{"t":"memecahkan masalah","zh":"解决问题"},"example":{"t":"Kami berusaha memecahkan masalah ini bersama-sama.","zh":"我们努力一起解决这个问题。"}},{"w":"terpecah","ipa":"/tərˈpɛtʃah/","zh":"分裂的，被打破的","phrase":{"t":"terpecah belah","zh":"被分裂的"},"example":{"t":"Kelompok itu terpecah belah menjadi dua kubu.","zh":"那个群体分裂成了两个阵营。"}},{"w":"pecahan","ipa":"/pəˈtʃahan/","zh":"碎片，分数","phrase":{"t":"pecahan mata uang","zh":"零钱，货币单位"},"example":{"t":"Bisa tukar dengan pecahan kecil?","zh":"能换成小面额的零钱吗？"}},{"w":"pemecah","ipa":"/pəˈmɛtʃah/","zh":"打破者，破碎机","phrase":{"t":"pemecah es","zh":"破冰船"},"example":{"t":"Kapal pemecah es itu membersihkan jalur pelayaran.","zh":"那艘破冰船清理了航道。"}},{"w":"pemecahan","ipa":"/pəˈmɛtʃahan/","zh":"解决，分裂","phrase":{"t":"pemecahan masalah","zh":"问题的解决"},"example":{"t":"Pemecahan masalah ini memerlukan waktu.","zh":"解决这个问题需要时间。"}}],"derSlugs":["pecah","memecah","memecahkan","terpecah","pecahan","pemecah","pemecahan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T02:05:41.718Z","src":"base"}